# TicTacToe (1s and 0s)

A C++ 2 player terminal-based TicTacToe game that uses 1s and 0s instead of Xs and Os.

## How to run and play through terminal

g++ main.cpp TicTacToe.cpp TicTacToeHelper.cpp -o tictactoe
./tictactoe

## How to Run (No Coding Required – Windows)

1. Download `TicTacToe.exe`
2. Double-click the file
3. The game will open in the terminal

No compiler or setup required.

